OL,3,GNEWSAMan,75, dies and woman seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and a woman has suffered
OL,7,Fserious injuries following a crash
OL,8,Finvolving three vehicles in Bicester.
OL,10,FThe crash on Tuesday involved a black
OL,11,FPeugeot 106, grey Honda HR-V and a blue
OL,12,FScania flat-bed truck at the Wretchwick
OL,13,FWay and Peregrine Way junction at about
OL,14,F10:00 BST.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police said the
OL,17,F75-year-old driver of the Peugeot died
OL,18,Fin the crash and a passenger remains in
OL,19,Fhospital with serious injuries. Police
OL,20,Fsaid their next of kin had been
OL,21,Finformed and were being supported.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
