OL,3,GNEWSAMan,75, dies and woman seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Honda suffered minor
OL,7,Finjuries and the truck driver was
OL,8,Funinjured. The force has appealed for
OL,9,Fwitnesses and any drivers with dash cam
OL,10,Ffootage to come forward.
